[h1]Operation Twin Strike[/h1]
[b]简体中文说明见下方。[/b]

[b]Work in progress (v0.1).[/b] A single-player Operation made as a showcase for warno-modkit, an open-source toolkit for building scripted WARNO Operations. To our knowledge, it is the first custom scripted Operation on the WARNO Workshop. It shows what the toolkit can build today. It is not a finished campaign and not a historical scenario. In English and Simplified Chinese.

[h2]The battle[/h2]
4 July 1989, two weeks into the war. You command the forward detachment of a Soviet tank division at the western edge of Twin Cities.
[list]
[*][b]Take the village.[/b] A West German Panzergrenadier company holds a road-junction village. The division's guns can fire a preparation on it first.
[*][b]Hold it.[/b] A US armoured task force counter-attacks up both roads from the south, into two fire boxes your division's guns cover.
[*][b]Decide.[/b] A West German Panzer battalion assembles south of the village, and Front offers one tactical nuclear strike on it. Ask for release, or fight it conventionally.
[/list]
Three difficulty levels and several endings.

[h2]Your forces[/h2]
T-80BV tanks, BMP-2 motor rifles, Konkurs-M teams in BTR-80s, engineers, scouts, Shilkas, 2S1s and Ka-29s, with the division's 2S7M and BM-27 batteries on call. Take the village and the division's reserve is yours: T-80Us, Ka-50s, Mi-24Vs and more air defence.

[b]Fictional.[/b] The setting, the formations and their orders of battle are invented for this showcase. Every unit is the game's own, on the stock Twin Cities map.

[h2]Known issues[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Deck:[/b] the buy menu also shows cards from RedJuggernaut, the stock Operation this one is built on, beside its own.
[*][b]The nuke:[/b] the game can slow down a lot after the strike while its smoke lingers. The strike lands in the fog of war, so you don't see the battalion being hit. You find the damage when you go in.
[*][b]Balance:[/b] not tuned. It has been played only a few times, on Medium.
[*][b]This game build:[/b] on 210942 it has been played through the nuclear strike; the ending hasn't been checked on it yet.
[*][b]Chinese text:[/b] new in this version; not yet checked in a full play.
[/list]

[h2]How to play[/h2]
[list]
[*]Subscribe, then switch the mod on in the Mod Center.
[*]Switch off any Gameplay (unit) mods first. With one active, the game restarts the Operation with all mods off.
[*]Start Operation Twin Strike from the Operations menu. Single-player only.
[/list]

[h2]Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Made for WARNO build 210942. A game update may break it until it is rebuilt.
[*]Unofficial. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Eugen Systems. Contains modified Eugen Systems game data.
[*]Built with warno-modkit (MIT licence): [url=https://{{repo}}]{{repo}}[/url]. Twin Strike's own source is in [url=https://{{repo}}/tree/main/components/ops/examples/twin-strike]the repo's examples[/url].
[*]Report bugs in the comments here, or as a GitHub issue.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]双重突击行动[/h1]
[b]开发中（v0.1）。[/b]单人行动，用于展示 warno-modkit：一套用于制作WARNO脚本行动的开源工具包。据我们所知，这是WARNO创意工坊上第一个自制脚本行动。它展示的是工具包目前能做到的程度，不是完整战役，也不是历史想定。支持英文和简体中文。

[h2]战斗经过[/h2]
1989年7月4日，开战两周。您指挥苏军一个坦克师的先遣支队，位于双城西缘。
[list]
[*][b]夺取村庄。[/b]西德一个装甲掷弹兵连扼守一个道路枢纽村庄。师炮兵可先对该村实施冲击炮火准备。
[*][b]扼守村庄。[/b]美军一个坦克营特遣队由南沿两条道路实施反冲击，进入师炮兵控制的两个火力区。
[*][b]作出决断。[/b]西德一个坦克营在村南集结，方面军提出对其实施一次战术核突击。请求批准使用核武器，或以常规手段作战。
[/list]
三个难度，多种结局。

[h2]我方兵力[/h2]
T-80BV坦克、乘BMP-2步兵战车的摩步、乘BTR-80的竞赛-M反坦克小组、工兵、侦察兵、石勒喀自行高炮、2S1自行榴弹炮和Ka-29直升机，师炮兵2S7M炮兵连和BM-27火箭炮连随时待命。夺取村庄后，师预备队归您指挥：T-80U坦克、Ka-50和Mi-24V直升机，以及更多防空兵器。

[b]纯属虚构。[/b]想定、部队及其编成均为本展示而设。所有单位均为游戏原有单位，地图为原版双城地图。

[h2]已知问题[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]卡组：[/b]购买菜单除本行动的卡片外，还会显示RedJuggernaut（本行动所基于的原版行动）的卡片。
[*][b]核突击：[/b]核突击后烟雾未散时，游戏可能明显变慢。核突击落在战争迷雾中，您看不到敌营被击中，进入后才能看到毁伤效果。
[*][b]平衡：[/b]尚未调整，仅在标准难度下玩过几次。
[*][b]当前游戏版本：[/b]在210942版本上已玩到核突击之后，结局尚未在该版本上检查。
[*][b]中文文本：[/b]本版本新增，尚未在完整游戏过程中检查。
[/list]

[h2]游玩方法[/h2]
[list]
[*]订阅后，在模组中心启用本模组。
[*]先停用所有游戏玩法（单位）模组。若有此类模组启用，游戏会在停用所有模组的情况下重新开始本行动。
[*]在“行动”菜单中开始双重突击行动。仅限单人游戏。
[/list]

[h2]说明[/h2]
[list]
[*]为WARNO 210942版本制作。游戏更新后，重新构建之前本模组可能无法运行。
[*]非官方模组，与Eugen Systems无关，也未获其认可。包含经修改的Eugen Systems游戏数据。
[*]使用 warno-modkit（MIT许可证）制作：[url=https://{{repo}}]{{repo}}[/url]。双重突击行动的源代码见[url=https://{{repo}}/tree/main/components/ops/examples/twin-strike]仓库中的示例[/url]。
[*]请在此处评论区或GitHub issue中报告错误。
[/list]
